   }
  },
  {
   "sid": "s8",
   "date": "2026-01-15",
   "url": "https://search.ftc.gov/system/files/ftc_gov/pdf/meador-concurrences-keynote.pdf",
   "text": "This is the shadow that hovers over our debates about AI. We could—and should!—get exponential advances in engineering, medicine, scientific research, military and defense capabilities, and so on. We could cure cancer. We could send people to Mars. The promise is there. Or, on the other hand, we could end up with endless carousels of slop that deaden our imagination, stunt childhood development, degrade political discourse, and erode social trust.",
   "source_type": "official_statement",
   "attribution": {
    "kind": "personal",
